, 556.0]], 'the primary analysis by virtue of the primary analysis method. A sensitivity analysis of the', 0.9948407528193101], [[[179.0, 560.0], [1329.0, 558.0], [1329.0, 588.0], [179.0, 590.0]], 'primary outcome to the departure from MCAR missing data (to MAR) will be performed and is', 0.9864896234501613], [[[180.0, 593.0], [498.0, 594.0], [498.0, 621.0], [180.0, 620.0]], 'described in Section 9.4.3.', 0.9815442341345327], [[[180.0, 658.0], [1219.0, 657.0], [1219.0, 687.0], [180.0, 688.0]], 'Secondary efficacy and safety analyses will generally include available data within the', 0.9910498343665024], [[[180.0, 693.0], [1289.0, 693.0], [1289.0, 722.0], [180.0, 722.0]], 'assessment windows. For these analyses, no data will be excluded and no imputation will be', 0.9862878249751197], [[[179.0, 728.0], [1345.0, 728.0], [1345.0, 756.0], [179.0, 756.0]], 'performed for missing data, unless otherwise specified. For neurodevelopmental outcomes at 22-', 0.9956986732939457], [[[180.0, 761.0], [1266.0, 761.0], [1266.0, 791.0], [180.0, 791.0]], '26 months corrected age, adjudications may be performed by the NRN BiB and Follow up', 0.9985099683205286], [[[179.0, 793.0], [1331.0, 794.0], [1331.0, 827.0], [179.0, 826.0]], 'subcommittees, using investigators masked to treatment arm, in order to assign level of NDI for', 0.9881326788350155], [[[178.0, 826.0], [1160.0, 827.0], [1160.0, 863.0], [178.0, 862.0]], 'babies assessed at follow up, but with partially missing neurodevelopmental data.', 0.9924304161542727], [[[178.0, 892.0], [747.0, 895.0], [747.0, 928.0], [178.0, 925.0]], '7.4  Interim Analyses and Data Monitoring', 0.963011424715926], [[[181.0, 957.0], [1266.0, 958.0], [1266.0, 991.0], [181.0, 990.0]], 'While the study is ongoing, the independent NRN Data and Safety Monitoring Committee', 0.9882863284576506], [[[180.0, 992.0], [1326.0, 991.0], [1326.0, 1024.0], [180.0, 1025.0]], '(DSMC) will examine accumulated data to ensure protection of subjects’ safety and assure that', 0.9938285164935614], [[[180.0, 1027.0], [1330.0, 1027.0], [1330.0, 1057.0], [180.0, 1057.0]], "the study's scientific goals are being met. Routine monitoring of safety and three formal interim", 0.9891924495549546], [[[180.0, 1063.0], [1274.0, 1061.0], [1274.0, 1091.0], [180.0, 1093.0]], 'analyses of efficacy are planned for this study. All interim analyses will be overseen by the', 0.9889242604214658], [[[179.0, 1097.0], [1309.0, 1097.0], [1309.0, 1127.0], [179.0, 1127.0]], 'DSMC, an independent monitoring body that is not involved with the conduct of the trial, and', 0.9974793843601061], [[[179.0, 1131.0], [1277.0, 1130.0], [1277.0, 1160.0], [179.0, 1161.0]], 'the only individuals other than the DsMC who will have access to the results of the interim', 0.9902533214170854], [[[181.0, 1166.0], [1299.0, 1166.0], [1299.0, 1196.0], [181.0, 1196.0]], 'analysis are the DCC study statistician and a second DCC statistician assigned to validate the', 0.9924519930748229], [[[178.0, 1201.0], [1316.0, 1200.0], [1316.0, 1230.0], [178.0, 1231.0]], 'results. Study investigators will not have any access to interim data. As the NRN is set up with', 0.9959500351299843], [[[179.0, 1235.0], [1353.0, 1235.0], [1353.0, 1266.0], [179.0, 1266.0]], 'an independent DCC with its own stream of funding, with long-time, well-established procedures', 0.9818869321904284], [[[176.0, 1267.0], [1280.0, 1268.0], [1280.0, 1301.0], [176.0, 1300.0]], 'for maintaining masking while collecting data for generating the needed trial reports for the', 0.9966156527560245], [[[179.0, 1303.0], [1308.0, 1303.0], [1308.0, 1332.0], [179.0, 1332.0]], 'DSMC, the potential for unmasking individuals other than the DCC study statisticians and the', 0.9866014349719753], [[[179.0, 1338.0], [1244.0, 1338.0], [1244.0, 1367.0], [179.0, 1367.0]], 'DSMC members is minimal. The following three sub-sections detail the interim analysis', 0.99260413646698], [[[180.0, 1373.0], [1279.0, 1373.0], [1279.0, 1402.0], [180.0, 1402.0]], 'methods for safety, efficacy, and futility to provide the DsMC the necessary information to', 0.9976665737864735], [[[177.0, 1407.0], [1304.0, 1406.0], [1304.0, 1439.0], [177.0, 1440.0]], 'recommend suspending or stopping study enrollment. Recommendations from the DsMC are', 0.9816861826749075], [[[180.0, 1441.0], [1304.0, 1443.0], [1304.0, 1472.0], [180.0, 1470.0]], 'addressed to the Director of NICHD, who has the ultimate responsibility to make decisions to', 0.9970752350662065], [[[180.0, 1475.0], [520.0, 1478.0], [520.0, 1508.0], [180.0, 1505.0]], 'alter or halt this NRN study.', 0.9910487059889168], [[[179.0, 1537.0], [351.0, 1542.0], [350.0, 1576.0], [178.0, 1570.0]], '7.4.1Safety', 0.9997032067992471], [[[180.0, 1606.0], [1302.0, 1606.0], [1302.0, 1636.0], [180.0, 1636.0]], 'The DsMC will review safety monitoring reports, generated by the DCC, that include tabular', 0.9873699565728505], [[[181.0, 1641.0], [1289.0, 1641.0], [1289.0, 1670.0], [181.0, 1670.0]], 'summaries of adverse events (AEs) and study data to determine whether there are any safety', 0.9897612750530242], [[[179.0, 1675.0], [1320.0, 1673.0], [1320.0, 1703.0], [179.0, 1705.0]], 'concerns that may impact continuation of the trial, or evidence that study procedures should be', 0.9900514314049169], [[[181.0, 1709.0], [1331.0, 1709.0], [1331.0, 1738.0], [181.0, 1738.0]], 'changed or the trial should be halted, only for reasons relating to the safety of the study subjects', 0.9846261501312256], [[[180.0, 1744.0], [1319.0, 1744.0], [1319.0, 1774.0], [180.0, 1774.0]], 'or inadequate trial performance (e.g., poor recruitment of subjects). Pre-specified formal safety', 0.9920438650957087], [[[179.0, 1835.0], [379.0, 1837.0], [378.0, 1864.0], [179.0, 1862.0]], 'Version 1.3,2024-09-10', 0.9844806383956562], [[[1284.0, 1836.0], [1353.0, 1836.0], [1353.0, 1864.0], [1284.0, 1864.0]], 'Page 18', 0.9969751494271415]]
